{
    "title": "Aura: Security & Protection",
    "description": "The smart, simple way to stay safe online and protect from fraud and scams.\r\n\r\nAura is an all-in-one digital safety and protection solution that helps keep you safe from identity theft, financial fraud, and online threats. Protect your data and stay one step ahead of threats.\r\n\r\nOur award-winning technology\u00b9 provides all-in-one security & protection by monitoring and alerting if your identity, data, passwords, credit, or financial accounts are at risk. Aura alerts you to credit fraud up to 250x faster than the competition.\u00b2 Aura\u2019s protection & security helps stop threats before they strike.\r\n\r\nDownload Aura today for digital identity protection & security.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25ba FAST FRAUD PROTECTION ALERTS ON THE GO </b>\r\nGet identity and credit fraud alerts sent to your mobile for security and protection so you can take action to prevent financial loss and scams.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25ba BROWSE ONLINE SAFELY</b>\r\nProtect your identity while shopping, banking, and browsing with our easy-to-use VPN. Block millions of malicious (e.g., malware, phishing) sites and online threats that may steal your info. With 100+ virtual locations, access your favorite global sites and apps with connection speeds that won't slow you down.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25baPROTECT YOUR PERSONAL INFO FROM DATA BROKERS</b>\r\nData brokers collect and sell your info to advertisers\u2014exposing you to unwanted ads, spam, and scams. Aura requests the removal of your data so you can take control of your privacy & safety.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25ba GUARD YOUR FINANCES</b>\r\nKeep your financial accounts safe by catching early signs of fraud. Link your accounts, set spending alerts, and we'll notify you of suspicious transactions, helping you stay on top of your banking transactions and keeping your finances secure.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25ba PREVENT CREDIT FRAUD WITH ONE TAP</b>\r\nInstantly lock your credit to prevent thieves and threats from opening credit cards or loans in your name. Keep track of your credit health by accessing your credit score and 3B annual credit reports\u00b3.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25ba EASY ACCESS TO YOUR PASSWORDS</b>\r\nProtect your accounts from breaches with strong passwords. Store all your passwords, autofill your logins, and easily sync them.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25baKEEP KIDS SAFE FROM HARMFUL SITES</b>\r\n(only for subscriptions with Parental Controls enabled)\r\nMonitor internet usage, filter content, and manage time online. Aura\u2019s parental control features use a local VPN installed on a child's device to apply content blocking and time limits.\r\n\r\n- Free trial: free of charge; no commitment; cancel anytime\r\n- Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before end of trial period.\r\n- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of current period, and identify cost of the renewal.\r\n- Subscriptions may be managed by user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.\r\n- No cancellation of current subscription allowed during active subscription period.\r\n- Any unused portion of free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when user purchases a subscription.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.aura.com/legal/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Service: https://aura.com/legal/service-terms\r\n\r\n\u00b9 Ranked #1 by Security.Org and IdentityProtectionReview.com. They may be compensated as a marketing affiliate of Aura, but their ratings are all their own.\r\n\u00b2As compared to the competition. Results based on a 2022 mystery shopper consumer study conducted by ath Power Consulting. ath Power Consulting was compensated by Aura to conduct this study.\r\n\u00b3 Score you receive with Aura is provided for educational purposes to help you understand your credit. It is calculated using information contained in your TransUnion or Experian credit file. Lenders use many different credit scoring systems, and the score you receive with Aura is not the same score used by lenders to evaluate your credit.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The smart, simple way to stay safe online and protect from fraud and scams.<br><br>Aura is an all-in-one digital safety and protection solution that helps keep you safe from identity theft, financial fraud, and online threats. Protect your data and stay one step ahead of threats.<br><br>Our award-winning technology\u00b9 provides all-in-one security &amp; protection by monitoring and alerting if your identity, data, passwords, credit, or financial accounts are at risk. Aura alerts you to credit fraud up to 250x faster than the competition.\u00b2 Aura\u2019s protection &amp; security helps stop threats before they strike.<br><br>Download Aura today for digital identity protection &amp; security.<br><br><b>\u25ba FAST FRAUD PROTECTION ALERTS ON THE GO </b><br>Get identity and credit fraud alerts sent to your mobile for security and protection so you can take action to prevent financial loss and scams.<br><br><b>\u25ba BROWSE ONLINE SAFELY</b><br>Protect your identity while shopping, banking, and browsing with our easy-to-use VPN. Block millions of malicious (e.g., malware, phishing) sites and online threats that may steal your info. With 100+ virtual locations, access your favorite global sites and apps with connection speeds that won&#39;t slow you down.<br><br><b>\u25baPROTECT YOUR PERSONAL INFO FROM DATA BROKERS</b><br>Data brokers collect and sell your info to advertisers\u2014exposing you to unwanted ads, spam, and scams. Aura requests the removal of your data so you can take control of your privacy &amp; safety.<br><br><b>\u25ba GUARD YOUR FINANCES</b><br>Keep your financial accounts safe by catching early signs of fraud. Link your accounts, set spending alerts, and we&#39;ll notify you of suspicious transactions, helping you stay on top of your banking transactions and keeping your finances secure.<br><br><b>\u25ba PREVENT CREDIT FRAUD WITH ONE TAP</b><br>Instantly lock your credit to prevent thieves and threats from opening credit cards or loans in your name. Keep track of your credit health by accessing your credit score and 3B annual credit reports\u00b3.<br><br><b>\u25ba EASY ACCESS TO YOUR PASSWORDS</b><br>Protect your accounts from breaches with strong passwords. Store all your passwords, autofill your logins, and easily sync them.<br><br><b>\u25baKEEP KIDS SAFE FROM HARMFUL SITES</b><br>(only for subscriptions with Parental Controls enabled)<br>Monitor internet usage, filter content, and manage time online. Aura\u2019s parental control features use a local VPN installed on a child&#39;s device to apply content blocking and time limits.<br><br>- Free trial: free of charge; no commitment; cancel anytime<br>- Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.<br>- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before end of trial period.<br>- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of current period, and identify cost of the renewal.<br>- Subscriptions may be managed by user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.<br>- No cancellation of current subscription allowed during active subscription period.<br>- Any unused portion of free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when user purchases a subscription.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.aura.com/legal/privacy-policy<br>Terms of Service: https://aura.com/legal/service-terms<br><br>\u00b9 Ranked #1 by Security.Org and IdentityProtectionReview.com. They may be compensated as a marketing affiliate of Aura, but their ratings are all their own.<br>\u00b2As compared to the competition. Results based on a 2022 mystery shopper consumer study conducted by ath Power Consulting. ath Power Consulting was compensated by Aura to conduct this study.<br>\u00b3 Score you receive with Aura is provided for educational purposes to help you understand your credit. It is calculated using information contained in your TransUnion or Experian credit file. Lenders use many different credit scoring systems, and the score you receive with Aura is not the same score used by lenders to evaluate your credit.",
